   "pron": "dou not Ô-peunn dheu RÉÏ-di-éï-teur wèn it iz hot.",
   "trou": "radiator"
  },
  {
   "id": "p12",
   "en": "When was the last oil change?",
   "fr": "À quand remonte la dernière vidange ?",
   "pron": "wèn woz dheu lâst OÏL tchéïndj ?",
   "trou": "last"
  },
  {
   "id": "p13",
   "en": "Your car needs a service.",
   "fr": "Votre voiture a besoin d'une révision.",
   "pron": "yôr kâr niidz eu SEUR-viss.",
   "trou": "service"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14",
   "en": "I need to order a spare part.",
   "fr": "Je dois commander une pièce de rechange.",
   "pron": "aï niid tou ÔR-deur eu SPÈR pârt.",
   "trou": "order"
  },
  {
   "id": "p15",
